e references as possible that would be great! Thank you for your time. Could you also provide the PSD file.\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/18Z1qdfPuXSTX9u8oi6OvxPoqs9tSIBe0?usp=sharing", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@dpopic3/works/18", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/e220f9c9/uploads/origins/a2f05b1a-5cd5-415e-83e8-c8203f7385a1?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=748e22392b30c56cf9171bdc10b6125b", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/e220f9c9/uploads/origins/a2f05b1a-5cd5-415e-83e8-c8203f7385a1?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=748e22392b30c56cf9171bdc10b6125b, https://si.imgix.net/e220f9c9/uploads/origins/a2f05b1a-5cd5-415e-83e8-c8203f7385a1?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=dec3a7cb76dde5b2339245ae5a5e09f0 2x, https://si.imgix.net/e220f9c9/uploads/origins/a2f05b1a-5cd5-415e-83e8-c8203f7385a1?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=6b0ac3402a45db2435578423f8d84e19 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "こんにちは。あなたのアートワークは素晴らしいですね。私のFFXIVのキャラクターを描くことを検討してください。ポーズや表情はお任せします。\n\n- 優しくて、思いやりがあって、親しみやすい\n- 彼女は紫色の猫です。\n- 彼女は夜と自然が大好きです。\n- 顔のそばかすはとても重要ですので、必ず入れてください。\n\n https://imgur.com/gallery/sDUu46d", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@dpopic3/works/17", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/5e9ee722/uploads/origins/3eea6b21-ebf1-458b-8ecc-3bc1a4e4338e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=ee84acdbd606cc47f6e4b4aca5d84ad9", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/5e9ee722/uploads/origins/3eea6b21-ebf1-458b-8ecc-3bc1a4e4338e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=ee84acdbd606cc47f6e4b4aca5d84ad9, https://si.imgix.net/5e9ee722/uploads/origins/3eea6b21-ebf1-458b-8ecc-3bc1a4e4338e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=92de27e34ce3d5a8b780b2